# data_axondeepseg_vcu
This dataset contains Bright-Field images provided by Charles Reiter from Virginia
Commonwealth University (VCU), supervised by Dr Geetanjali Bendale. These images 
were stained with Toluidine Blue at a 40x magnification. The samples were taken 
from tibial nerves of male New Zealand white rabbits.

- 8/14 images are fully annotated, with axon and myelin labels
- 6/14 images are unannotated
- data originally used in https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10517328/#s017

BIDS version 1.7.0